          "Each branch in (1.11) applies throughout its indicated open spatial half-line at initial time; the display does not constrain q at positive times [printed page 5, (1.11)].",
          "Neither equality with q_l nor equality with q_r is specified at x = 0 [printed page 5, (1.11), strict inequalities]."
        ]
      },
      {
