    {
      "issue": "Whether equal left and right states are included as a degenerate Riemann problem.",
      "evidence": "Printed page 5, Section 1.2.1, calls the data a “single jump discontinuity,” but (1.11) does not explicitly state q_l ≠ q_r.",
      "impact": "The prose describes a genuine jump, while the displayed equations alone allow equal states. The source does not explicitly settle inclusion of the degenerate case."
    },
    {
      "issue": "The initial value at the interface.",
